['MemMachine Student Ambassador','MemMachine','Open-source AI student ambassador','Discord introduction route advertised; live acceptance not verified','Not stated','Students worldwide, no stated India restriction','Strong student fit if able to host 1–2 events per semester; six-month active term','https://memmachine.ai/community-student-ambassador-program/','Join Discord and introduce yourself in ambassadors channel with idea and links; no form submission tested.'],
['OpenSearch Ambassador','OpenSearch Software Foundation','Open source search developer ambassador','Year-round application; twice-yearly review','None; reviews February and August','Community members who help others learn OpenSearch; geography not specified','Good conditional fit; all-around expertise not required; show interest and how to contribute','https://opensearch.org/blog/opensearch-ambassador-applications-are-now-open-year-round/','Organizer says rolling year-round; application https://forms.gle/gYT5P6sZLHHx5tGy7 did not render in research tool.'],
['OpenSSF Ambassador','Open Source Security Foundation','Open source security advocacy','Rolling intake stated in March 2026 announcement; live form unverified','No deadline stated','Open source community experience, communication and security interest; global','Conditional; existing open-source security involvement helps','https://openssf.org/blog/2026/03/23/introducing-the-openssf-ambassador-program/','Organizer says rolling with initial response in 1–2 weeks; linked page routes to program details rather than direct form.'],
